# Required substrings in the final frame of text-input.tape.
# `cargo xtask record e2e --check` fails if any is missing — i.e. a real
# terminal failed to deliver Home/End/arrows/Delete/Backspace or the
# Ctrl+A/Ctrl+E modifier shortcuts into the input end to end.
#
# The exact assembled state after the scripted key sequence:
STATE val=Xhel cur=4 len=4
# And the field rendered its caret at the end (cur == len):
field: Xhel‹
# Sanity: the fixture's own title line rendered.
rstui text-input e2e
